<TITLE>Oil Jet</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>Oil jets have been provided in the cylinder block. By spraying oil into the cylinders, friction is reduced, piston durability is improved by suppressing temperature rise, and knocking is prevented.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The oil jets have built-in check valves that stop the oil supply when the oil pressure is low, preventing a drop in oil pressure throughout the engine.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
